WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.820
A black hole traps light.

2
00:00:01.785 --> 00:00:04.980
So why is this one surrounded by a bright ring?

3
00:00:04.945 --> 00:00:07.260
We’re seeing glowing gas outside it,

4
00:00:07.225 --> 00:00:08.350
around a dark shadow.

5
00:00:08.805 --> 00:00:12.020
From above, the gas forms a flat, swirling disk.

6
00:00:11.985 --> 00:00:14.800
As it moves inward, it heats up and glows.

7
00:00:14.765 --> 00:00:16.830
The gas gives us the light we can see.

8
00:00:17.385 --> 00:00:19.320
Now follow the light.

9
00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:21.860
Gravity bends its path around the black hole.

10
00:00:21.825 --> 00:00:24.100
Light from the far side can reach our eyes,

11
00:00:24.065 --> 00:00:25.480
making the disk appear to curve

12
00:00:25.445 --> 00:00:27.190
above and below the shadow.
